NOTICE for the third-party source vendored under vendor/anydoc/
================================================================

This directory contains source code that omniweave does not own. The copy exists so that
omniweave's own reviewers can read the code that runs inside their process -- `parse.office.anydoc`
is the one driver the host grants `Isolation.INPROC` (04-driver-system.md section 6, DR9), and the
`vendored` trust tier that makes it eligible is granted over exactly the bytes listed in
anydoc.sha256 and over nothing else.

omniweave does not build this code. The binary that runs is the published `abi3` wheel
`firecrawl-anydoc == 0.2.4`, resolved by `packages/omniweave-office/pyproject.toml`. This tree is the
audit copy and the fork's starting point (FORK-TRIGGER.md); it is not a build input, and no
`pyproject.toml` in this repository points at it.

